    {
      "id": "opera-q01",
      "question": "四大徽班指哪四个戏班？它们进京与京剧形成是什么关系？",
      "annotationStatus": "assistant_source_checked_candidate",
      "expectInsufficient": false,
      "idempotencyKey": "eval-eec82228858949858ea0db9e13ae4d59-1-6e72e2620751",
      "attempts": 1,
      "status": "response_received",
      "startedAt": "2026-10-10T13:32:53.193820+08:00",
      "httpStatus": 200,
      "headerRequestId": "3928e84b-f4b7-4ca4-a52b-885e801d2896",
      "rawResponseSHA256": "9b8c255a3ef2f4047471035bb24009d58c7af343d12003d612b82b217e9ed093",
      "response": {
        "answer": "四大徽班指的是三庆、四喜、春台、和春这四个徽班。它们进京是京剧形成过程中的一个重要发展节点：徽班进京后，与汉调艺人合作，并吸收了昆曲、秦腔等艺术因素，逐步推动了京剧的形成。不过，徽班进京并不等于京剧在一天之内就完成了形成，京剧的形成是一个逐步交流、融合的过程。",
        "citations": [
          {
            "id": "chunk_dea75128ab6aa601ff5e9b1e832fe7fc598e7c8c5bee3721e9930f9b402e9826",
            "title": "京剧",
            "sourceId": "ihchina-jingju",
            "locator": "项目正文第一段 · 入库片段 1/1",
            "url": "https://www.ihchina.cn/project_details/13201",
            "excerpt": "京剧形成于清代的剧种交流过程。\n三庆、四喜、春台、和春徽班进京后，与汉调艺人合作，并吸收昆曲、秦腔等艺术因素。\n徽班进京是发展节点，不能等同于一日完成剧种形成。",
            "contentKind": "original_fact_summary"
          }
        ],
        "uncertain": false,
        "requestId": "3928e84b-f4b7-4ca4-a52b-885e801d2896"
      },
      "responseSchemaValid": true,
      "redactionApplied": false,
      "requestId": "3928e84b-f4b7-4ca4-a52b-885e801d2896",
      "elapsedSeconds": 1.753162,
      "finishedAt": "2026-10-10T13:32:54.950701+08:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "opera-q02",
      "question": "京剧主要使用哪两种声腔？",
      "annotationStatus": "assistant_source_checked_candidate",
      "expectInsufficient": false,
      "idempotencyKey": "eval-eec82228858949858ea0db9e13ae4d59-2-c0570c1eec1a",
      "attempts": 1,
      "status": "response_received",
      "startedAt": "2026-10-10T13:32:54.951704+08:00",
      "httpStatus": 200,
      "headerRequestId": "6ee7306d-26ff-4305-8dba-f34136f95b85",
      "rawResponseSHA256": "84e51b05b5c446a98d00e5919ac8515b69e1a21fc93a2bb510052d023d0d5b71",
      "response": {
        "answer": "京剧主要使用西皮和二簧两种声腔。概括来说，二簧较舒缓凝重，西皮较明快起伏；不过具体唱段的情绪表达，还要结合唱段本身来看。",
        "citations": [
          {
            "id": "chunk_b40ee72d545e8fc3fc08893ebebdfcde3da5babe4fe9cad964b83e118859418a",
            "title": "京剧",
            "sourceId": "ihchina-jingju",
            "locator": "项目正文第二段：唱腔 · 入库片段 1/1",
            "url": "https://www.ihchina.cn/project_details/13201",
            "excerpt": "京剧主要使用西皮和二簧声腔。\n概括而言，二簧较舒缓凝重，西皮较明快起伏；\n这是声腔特点的基础介绍，具体情绪表达仍须结合唱段。",
            "contentKind": "original_fact_summary"
          }
        ],
        "uncertain": false,
        "requestId": "6ee7306d-26ff-4305-8dba-f34136f95b85"
      },
