    {
      "id": "opera-q06",
      "question": "《三岔口》中的任堂惠和刘利华为什么在夜里交手，误会怎样化解？",
      "annotationStatus": "assistant_source_checked_candidate",
      "expectInsufficient": false,
      "idempotencyKey": "eval-eec82228858949858ea0db9e13ae4d59-6-604960af5f1a",
      "attempts": 1,
      "status": "response_received",
      "startedAt": "2026-10-10T13:33:01.258881+08:00",
      "httpStatus": 200,
      "headerRequestId": "77e3863c-53c8-425c-ac34-b82418745317",
      "rawResponseSHA256": "bc1685f7f647ab3fa685422b2506404905bac2a5837771f84ce31e190d76234c",
      "response": {
        "answer": "《三岔口》里，任堂惠和刘利华夜里交手，是因为刘利华夫妇误把任堂惠当成了敌人。这场冲突并不是两人真正立场敌对，后来焦赞赶到，才把误会解开。",
        "citations": [
          {
            "id": "chunk_97a45b71a7ef0f438300dea22d63f927734f2fdf9863b22aba3faeac2510b838",
            "title": "三岔口",
            "sourceId": "cnpoc-sanchakou",
            "locator": "剧目简介后半段 · 入库片段 1/1",
            "url": "https://www.cnpoc.cn/cnpoc/mbs/200806/aa3b20102b2548378a92ccc640c25eb2.shtml",
            "excerpt": "刘利华夫妇误把任堂惠当作敌人，任、刘在黑夜交手。\n焦赞赶到后才解开误会，所以这场冲突并非两人立场真正敌对。",
            "contentKind": "original_fact_summary"
          },
          {
            "id": "chunk_c48ba80c09004938c4d59b77c3acb0c72bdd9f123c2428ccc325b9e7bcfdf81f",
            "title": "三岔口",
            "sourceId": "cnpoc-sanchakou",
            "locator": "剧目简介开头；主要演员 · 入库片段 1/1",
            "url": "https://www.cnpoc.cn/cnpoc/mbs/200806/aa3b20102b2548378a92ccc640c25eb2.shtml",
            "excerpt": "《三岔口》涉及被发配的焦赞、跟随相救的任堂惠和店主刘利华。\n该院演员表也分别列出任堂惠、刘利华两角色。",
            "contentKind": "original_fact_summary"
          }
        ],
        "uncertain": false,
        "requestId": "77e3863c-53c8-425c-ac34-b82418745317"
      },
