    {
      "id": "opera-q10",
      "question": "青衣与花旦的表演侧重有什么常见差别？",
      "annotationStatus": "assistant_source_checked_candidate",
      "expectInsufficient": false,
      "idempotencyKey": "eval-eec82228858949858ea0db9e13ae4d59-10-00253145bd09",
      "attempts": 1,
      "status": "response_received",
      "startedAt": "2026-10-10T13:33:08.411014+08:00",
      "httpStatus": 200,
      "headerRequestId": "e5c08f8a-20c8-4df8-8ce7-39cb9420f167",
      "rawResponseSHA256": "8d1d642624069689ce17f25b53744bd09d56f9fa2104070a197a1c80650054eb",
      "response": {
        "answer": "青衣也称正旦，常表现举止稳重的中青年女性，表演上更重唱功。花旦则常表现年轻、活泼的女性，表演上更多侧重做功和说白。这些属于入门层面的概括，实际剧目中不同流派、不同人物的处理会有所变化。",
        "citations": [
          {
            "id": "chunk_e1cabef0599df5a4867813621d2c8667d35d57fdde1d506969789853a86dc2dd",
            "title": "京剧旦行小讲堂",
            "sourceId": "cnpoc-dan",
            "locator": "正文（1）正旦、（2）花旦 · 入库片段 1/1",
            "url": "https://www.cnpoc.cn/cnpoc/gjkt/202510/a326678b61884605ab9ed5bf511a83e8.shtml",
            "excerpt": "青衣也称正旦，常表现举止稳重的中青年女性，重唱功。\n花旦常表现年轻、活泼的女性，更多侧重做功和说白；\n这属于入门概括。",
            "contentKind": "original_fact_summary"
          }
        ],
        "uncertain": false,
        "requestId": "e5c08f8a-20c8-4df8-8ce7-39cb9420f167"
      },
      "responseSchemaValid": true,
      "redactionApplied": false,
      "requestId": "e5c08f8a-20c8-4df8-8ce7-39cb9420f167",
      "elapsedSeconds": 1.581833,
