      "elapsedSeconds": 1.87825,
      "finishedAt": "2026-10-10T13:33:11.876319+08:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "opera-q12",
      "question": "京剧脸谱的红色作主色和作副色，意义一定相同吗？",
      "annotationStatus": "assistant_source_checked_candidate",
      "expectInsufficient": false,
      "idempotencyKey": "eval-eec82228858949858ea0db9e13ae4d59-12-b12f915c51bf",
      "attempts": 1,
      "status": "response_received",
      "startedAt": "2026-10-10T13:33:11.878324+08:00",
      "httpStatus": 200,
      "headerRequestId": "2302c46c-3f3d-4693-a880-0d48d08355cb",
      "rawResponseSHA256": "e63663caa728eb3a7b54652bf7e2d03fe2b517b379431a5ec1d2618474b01fb8",
      "response": {
        "answer": "不一定相同。按现有资料，红色作主色时，常用于关羽等忠勇人物；作副色时，则可表达其他寓意。因此，不能把某一种颜色脱离人物、谱式和使用部位，解释成绝对的人格标签。",
        "citations": [
          {
            "id": "chunk_f9354a5998a732f6a5a2c25fac5aab61f96ba6f65a5cc83c9f218535ad739cb4",
            "title": "二、京剧脸谱",
            "sourceId": "cnpoc-face",
            "locator": "脸谱的色彩—红色；京剧脸谱的分类第二段 · 入库片段 1/1",
            "url": "https://www.cnpoc.cn/cnpoc/gjkt/200807/f1f8824fe1f4433a8f95a53f8e9278fa.shtml",
            "excerpt": "红色作主色时，常用于关羽等忠勇人物；\n作副色时可表达其他寓意。\n因此单个颜色不能脱离人物、谱式和使用部位解释成绝对人格标签。",
            "contentKind": "original_fact_summary"
          }
        ],
        "uncertain": false,
