    {
      "id": "opera-q13",
      "question": "三块瓦脸的名称和哪些脸部区域有关？",
      "annotationStatus": "assistant_source_checked_candidate",
      "expectInsufficient": false,
      "idempotencyKey": "eval-eec82228858949858ea0db9e13ae4d59-13-e60e0735b420",
      "attempts": 1,
      "status": "response_received",
      "startedAt": "2026-10-10T13:33:13.304152+08:00",
      "httpStatus": 200,
      "headerRequestId": "00e4994c-81be-4eff-81d3-f71f86dc23db",
      "rawResponseSHA256": "06c3784f432b19b37839073f2b40681efb2e036cb8824c41997346221a4bed44",
      "response": {
        "answer": "三块瓦脸的得名与脸部三个区域有关：两块眉区和一块鼻窝。它是在整脸的基础上，把这两块眉区和一块鼻窝加以突出，因此称为“三块瓦”。此外，三块瓦脸下面还有正、尖、花、老等不同变式。",
        "citations": [
          {
            "id": "chunk_2abe9910874768f0330681f4029bea959df5456309279854c10a1c2ddc03f445",
            "title": "二、京剧脸谱",
            "sourceId": "cnpoc-face",
            "locator": "京剧脸谱的分类—三块瓦脸 · 入库片段 1/1",
            "url": "https://www.cnpoc.cn/cnpoc/gjkt/200807/f1f8824fe1f4433a8f95a53f8e9278fa.shtml",
            "excerpt": "三块瓦脸在整脸基础上突出两块眉区与一块鼻窝，所以有三块瓦之称；\n其下还有正、尖、花、老等不同变式。",
            "contentKind": "original_fact_summary"
          }
        ],
        "uncertain": false,
        "requestId": "00e4994c-81be-4eff-81d3-f71f86dc23db"
      },
      "responseSchemaValid": true,
